dsh-restart-handoff README · Installing from a checkout：To wire it into a profile by hand instead:

```jsonc
// profiles/web/package.json
"dependencies": {
  "dsh-restart-handoff": "link:/path/to/dsh-restart-handoff"
},

Then `pnpm install` in the profile directory (`nodeLinker: hoisted`) and a
restart of the Host.
